  "releaseNotes": "Modernized for the 2026 .NET ecosystem after a long dormancy. Multi-targets netstandard2.0, net8.0, and net10.0. Drops embedded TaskBuilder.fs in favor of FSharp.Core's built-in `task { }` (requires FSharp.Core 8.0.401+). Replaces the custom IServiceConfig with the standard IServiceProvider. Adds PlanExecutor for DI-friendly plan execution. ServiceContext renamed to PlanContext. Breaking changes for code that used the old service-config API.",
